WEBVTT

01:33.040 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.200
EPISODE 2

01:41.460 --> 01:42.440
Lin Qile.

01:42.940 --> 01:44.540
What were you dreaming about during class?

02:17.640 --> 02:19.400
Yingtao, wipe the drool off your desk.

02:22.820 --> 02:23.660
Lin Qile.

02:24.180 --> 02:25.060
Lin Qile.

02:25.100 --> 02:26.200
Lin Qile.

02:26.820 --> 02:27.860
Wake up.

02:38.960 --> 02:39.800
What's going on?

02:39.840 --> 02:41.220
Ms. Wang wants you in the office.

02:41.260 --> 02:42.660
Your mom's here.

02:44.580 --> 02:45.880
Lin Qile's mom,

02:45.920 --> 02:48.340
you really need to pay attention to her.

02:48.380 --> 02:50.000
She's got potential.

02:50.040 --> 02:52.040
But her mind just isn't on her studies.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.280
She's already in Year 10.

02:53.780 --> 02:55.180
School started long ago.

02:55.220 --> 02:56.560
The college entrance exam is near.

02:57.220 --> 02:58.820
She's still writing letters during class.

02:59.320 --> 03:01.320
Several teachers have brought it up.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.760
Students at this age

03:03.260 --> 03:05.020
don't have much self-discipline.

03:05.060 --> 03:06.580
Parents need to take more responsibility.

03:06.620 --> 03:08.100
You're absolutely right.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.760
Thank you for taking care of her,
now and in the future.

03:11.340 --> 03:12.440
I'll head out now.

03:12.480 --> 03:13.800
Of course.

03:14.340 --> 03:16.220
Let's stay in touch.

03:16.260 --> 03:18.040
- No need to walk me out, Ms. Wang.
- Alright then.

03:18.080 --> 03:18.940
- Thank you.
- Sure.

03:35.200 --> 03:36.280
Come on, let's go.

03:45.700 --> 03:49.540
Yingtao, if you really want to
keep writing letters,

03:50.100 --> 03:51.040
then write them at home.

03:51.760 --> 03:54.240
I don't think writing letters is wrong,

03:54.740 --> 03:56.640
but doing it in class

03:56.680 --> 03:58.520
makes it harder for teachers
to manage the room.

04:00.320 --> 04:01.160
Mom…

04:02.580 --> 04:04.160
Am I…

04:05.160 --> 04:06.740
a weird kid?

04:07.380 --> 04:09.180
Why do I always make you and Dad worry?

04:17.579 --> 04:18.880
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

04:18.920 --> 04:19.899
You should be

04:20.399 --> 04:22.060
with your friends.

04:22.100 --> 04:25.820
But instead you're stuck out here,
alone in Qunshan.

04:26.620 --> 04:28.320
What are you talking about?

04:28.360 --> 04:30.020
I'm not alone.

04:30.060 --> 04:32.280
I have you. I have Dad.

04:32.320 --> 04:34.280
I have this town with mountains.

04:34.820 --> 04:36.680
I don't think I could ever leave you two.

04:36.720 --> 04:38.840
I want to stay and
be the last guardian of Qunshan.

04:39.820 --> 04:41.540
- Really?
- Really.

04:51.460 --> 04:52.300
Yingtao.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.000
You're growing up.

04:55.700 --> 04:57.920
It is a process of
stepping out of your old shell.

04:58.420 --> 05:01.460
If you keep locking yourself in the past,

05:01.960 --> 05:03.460
you'll suffocate.

05:04.000 --> 05:05.200
People move on.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.960
Feelings move on too.

05:07.540 --> 05:10.800
If you keep clinging to the past,
to what's already gone,

05:10.840 --> 05:12.080
of course you'll feel stuck.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.080
But if someone…

05:22.420 --> 05:24.660
can just let the past go,

05:26.480 --> 05:28.660
like none of it ever happened…

05:29.800 --> 05:31.820
doesn't that mean they're

05:32.400 --> 05:33.860
better off now?

05:39.140 --> 05:41.680
I don't know about other people…

05:42.220 --> 05:43.780
But I know

05:44.980 --> 05:47.340
you're not okay right now.

05:58.760 --> 05:59.980
Those letters

06:00.520 --> 06:02.060
will only make it when they are delivered.

06:02.100 --> 06:03.180
JIANG QIAOXI, HOW'S YOUR DAY?

06:03.220 --> 06:04.420
If you keep it here…

06:04.460 --> 06:05.500
JIANG QIAOXI, IT'S YINGTAO.

06:05.540 --> 06:06.560
…it just weighs you down.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.320
I'M IN YEAR 7 NOW.

06:08.360 --> 06:10.000
AND YOU? DO YOU LIKE IT THERE?

06:17.420 --> 06:18.640
Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:19.140 --> 06:20.700
The construction site's almost done.

06:21.200 --> 06:24.800
Those three water towers
don't light up at night anymore.

06:25.560 --> 06:29.120
Sometimes I wonder… if you ever
come back to Qunshan at night,

06:29.620 --> 06:31.640
and you don't see those lights,

06:32.140 --> 06:33.700
will you lose your way?

06:33.740 --> 06:35.860
JIANG QIAOXI, THE CHERRY SAGE IS SO SWEET.

06:35.900 --> 06:37.080
Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:37.580 --> 06:39.280
The cherry sage is so sweet.

06:39.780 --> 06:42.180
Every time I eat it,
I want to save some for you.

06:42.220 --> 06:43.160
IF WE EVER MEET AGAIN…

06:43.200 --> 06:44.400
If we ever

06:44.900 --> 06:46.540
meet again in the summer,

06:47.040 --> 06:49.580
I'll bring some with me when I see you.

06:51.060 --> 06:52.100
Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:52.600 --> 06:53.880
It's been five years.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.420
How have you been?

06:57.560 --> 06:58.840
Chunlu passed away

06:59.540 --> 07:00.840
not long ago.

07:01.380 --> 07:03.080
Remember what we said about it,

07:03.120 --> 07:04.480
that she was your daughter?

07:05.240 --> 07:08.600
So I thought I should let you know.

07:09.260 --> 07:12.280
I buried her on that mountaintop
where we used to watch the sunset.

07:13.020 --> 07:14.520
You were those glowing clouds.

07:15.020 --> 07:15.880
This way,

07:16.380 --> 07:19.280
she can always be with you.

08:01.920 --> 08:03.740
Hello? Who is it?

08:03.780 --> 08:04.840
Lin Yingtao, it's me,

08:04.880 --> 08:05.880
Qin Yeyun?

08:05.920 --> 08:07.900
You're calling early. What's wrong?

08:07.940 --> 08:08.960
Lin Yingtao.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.720
Did you send Jiang Qiaoxi

08:11.260 --> 08:12.720
another long letter?

08:12.760 --> 08:13.860
How'd you know?

08:13.900 --> 08:16.380
I told you, stop contacting him.

08:20.140 --> 08:21.380
Why?

08:22.020 --> 08:23.080
He…

08:23.120 --> 08:24.940
He was busy again?

08:24.980 --> 08:26.640
Not have time to read a single letter?

08:26.680 --> 08:27.900
Who cares if he's busy?

08:27.940 --> 08:29.560
He's moved on. So should you.

08:29.600 --> 08:31.000
Stop thinking about him.

08:31.040 --> 08:32.299
Don't even mention his name.

08:32.340 --> 08:33.860
Tell her the truth! She can't…

08:33.900 --> 08:35.419
What truth?

08:36.960 --> 08:39.200
Qin Yeyun, what's going on?

08:39.240 --> 08:40.360
Did something happen?

08:40.400 --> 08:41.740
Don't ask.

08:41.780 --> 08:43.480
Just don't reach out to him again.
You can't.

08:46.280 --> 08:47.380
Wait, you…

09:38.400 --> 09:41.120
KING LONG COACH

09:52.500 --> 09:53.740
Jiang Qiaoxi!

09:53.780 --> 09:55.440
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

09:55.480 --> 09:56.640
Jiang Qiaoxi!

09:56.680 --> 09:58.740
Please write to me!

09:58.780 --> 10:00.440
You must write to me.

10:00.480 --> 10:01.520
Yingtao!

10:02.020 --> 10:04.120
I'll be back after winter break!

10:04.160 --> 10:05.060
Yingtao!

10:05.560 --> 10:07.460
I'll be back after winter break!

10:08.020 --> 10:09.000
I know.

10:10.560 --> 10:12.080
No matter how brave I am,

10:13.500 --> 10:15.300
I'll never grow wings.

10:35.980 --> 10:38.140
Girl. Girl.

10:38.640 --> 10:40.000
Are you carsick?

10:40.040 --> 10:41.560
Here, orange peel helps.

10:42.060 --> 10:43.640
- Try it.
- Thanks…

10:49.180 --> 10:52.320
JIALIN

11:09.860 --> 11:11.720
What is this place?

11:13.860 --> 11:15.020
BUS STATION

11:15.060 --> 11:18.660
BUS MAP

11:18.700 --> 11:21.200
JIALIN EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL

11:36.400 --> 11:37.860
- Hey, did you hear?
- Jiang Qiaoxi

11:37.900 --> 11:39.440
really used to live in Qunshan.

11:39.480 --> 11:41.880
I thought he went to elementary school
in Hong Kong.

11:41.920 --> 11:43.480
Now it's Qunshan? Which is it?

11:44.640 --> 11:45.920
I'm not really sure…

11:46.420 --> 11:48.340
Someone said a girl sent him a letter.

11:49.200 --> 11:50.960
And you're all just passing it around?

11:51.000 --> 11:52.860
Aren't you worried he'll be mad?

11:53.600 --> 11:54.620
Who knows?

11:55.120 --> 11:58.120
Yu Qiao and Fei Linge
were fighting over it in class earlier.

12:00.440 --> 12:04.500
I heard he transferred from Hong Kong to
No. 1 Experimental Primary in first grade.

12:04.540 --> 12:07.740
Fei Linge and Cen Xiaoman
were in that same class back then.

12:07.780 --> 12:10.440
Right, they used to study together.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.960
They were close friends.

12:12.460 --> 12:14.460
BUILD A BETTER LIFE TOGETHER

12:19.520 --> 12:21.360
LET CIVILITY GUIDE OUR WORDS AND DEEDS

12:21.900 --> 12:25.540
JIALIN EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL

12:35.760 --> 12:37.080
LIVE WITH HONOR, LEARN WITH HEART

12:51.520 --> 12:52.600
Yu Qiao!

13:02.580 --> 13:03.420
What's wrong?

13:04.700 --> 13:07.380
I think I heard someone
calling Yu Qiao at school.

13:08.120 --> 13:09.820
- Who?
- A girl.

13:09.860 --> 13:11.000
Sounded just like Yingtao.

13:11.040 --> 13:12.080
Yingtao?

13:13.140 --> 13:15.220
You must've imagined it.
No way she's here.

13:15.840 --> 13:17.340
Bus is here. Come on.

13:20.940 --> 13:22.040
DONGSHI ROAD

13:22.080 --> 13:22.920
Hey, you.

13:23.920 --> 13:25.720
Why aren't you wearing our school uniform?

13:26.300 --> 13:27.240
You don't go here, do you?

13:28.940 --> 13:30.700
I… I'm from No. 11 Middle School.

13:31.940 --> 13:32.860
No. 11 Middle?

13:33.700 --> 13:34.960
Looking for a friend.

13:35.820 --> 13:37.640
Don't tell me you're here
for Jiang Qiaoxi?

13:39.160 --> 13:41.600
You're that girl, Yingtao, right?

13:42.500 --> 13:44.340
What's going on between you two?

13:44.380 --> 13:46.140
Did you really write that letter?

13:47.860 --> 13:49.080
Writing a letter's one thing,

13:49.120 --> 13:50.800
but showing up at his school?

13:50.840 --> 13:51.700
God.

13:51.740 --> 13:52.960
She followed him all the way here.

13:53.000 --> 13:55.660
Maybe they really do know each other.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.280
Jiang Qiaoxi!

13:58.140 --> 13:59.080
Jiang Qiaoxi's here.

13:59.120 --> 13:59.980
Cen Xiaoman's with him.

14:02.100 --> 14:03.220
Jiang Qiaoxi!

14:04.340 --> 14:05.180
Jiang Qiaoxi!

14:08.740 --> 14:11.120
Guess what?
That girl actually came for you.

14:11.680 --> 14:14.080
She really didn't realize
how much trouble she's making for you?

14:15.260 --> 14:16.740
This is none of your business.

14:16.780 --> 14:19.120
And I don't need your help cleaning it up.

14:19.620 --> 14:20.460
But she…

15:07.420 --> 15:08.480
I don't know her.

15:11.040 --> 15:13.280
What? Who is she then?

15:14.060 --> 15:15.060
Doesn't know her?

15:15.560 --> 15:17.540
He probably just doesn't want to

15:17.580 --> 15:19.000
get involved with her.

15:19.040 --> 15:20.700
He should be telling the truth.

15:20.740 --> 15:22.260
He is too proud to lie.

15:22.300 --> 15:23.320
Seriously?

16:05.160 --> 16:06.680
Hey! Girl! Oh God!

16:06.720 --> 16:08.620
Get down! What are you doing?

16:09.120 --> 16:11.140
You could get hurt!

16:11.880 --> 16:12.720
Girl!

16:13.920 --> 16:14.760
Hey, um…

16:15.340 --> 16:18.320
Bad exam? Fight at home?

16:20.600 --> 16:21.520
Come on down.

16:21.560 --> 16:22.640
Quick.

16:22.680 --> 16:24.340
Here, I'll help you.

16:24.380 --> 16:25.580
Come down from there!

16:25.620 --> 16:26.940
Come on, don't be stupid.

16:26.980 --> 16:28.940
Come down, it's too high!

16:28.980 --> 16:30.760
Quick! Come on.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.280
Easy, take it slow…

16:35.320 --> 16:36.460
I wasn't trying to jump…

16:36.500 --> 16:38.120
- Come on.
- I really wasn't…

16:38.800 --> 16:39.640
Careful.

16:39.680 --> 16:41.260
See how high that was?

16:41.300 --> 16:43.440
- I'm fine.
- Still, that is dangerous, huh?

16:43.480 --> 16:44.380
Come on!

16:44.900 --> 16:45.960
Where's your family?

16:46.860 --> 16:48.000
Come on, sit here a while.

16:52.580 --> 16:53.460
The soda's cold.

16:53.500 --> 16:54.920
Here, have some hot water.

16:55.800 --> 16:57.600
- Thanks.
- Let it cool down.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.160
Watch some TV.

17:04.200 --> 17:05.180
This one's good.

17:20.319 --> 17:21.740
Men like him

17:21.780 --> 17:23.020
don't come around often.

18:07.280 --> 18:09.900
Auntie, I should get going. Thank you.

18:10.620 --> 18:12.380
Don't go just yet, girl.

18:12.420 --> 18:14.080
There's somewhere I want to take you.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.000
Here.

19:44.740 --> 19:45.720
Jiang Qiaoxi.

19:45.760 --> 19:47.300
Your mom called.

19:47.340 --> 19:48.320
She's coming to get you.

19:48.860 --> 19:49.920
Were you following me?

19:50.700 --> 19:52.160
You seemed off.

19:52.200 --> 19:53.040
So I…

19:53.580 --> 19:55.100
Don't worry, I won't tell your mom.

20:06.100 --> 20:06.940
Girl!

20:07.720 --> 20:08.560
Come on.

20:12.460 --> 20:13.600
Let me show you something.

20:14.460 --> 20:15.300
Wait up.

20:19.920 --> 20:20.760
Watch your step.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.760
Yingtao!

21:07.100 --> 21:07.940
Yingtao.

21:19.000 --> 21:20.040
What happened to you?

21:22.220 --> 21:23.220
Who even are you?

21:24.540 --> 21:25.260
I…

21:27.380 --> 21:29.280
You're hurt and still making jokes?

21:29.320 --> 21:31.160
How did you hurt your ankle? Is it bad?

21:31.200 --> 21:32.680
It's nothing. I…

21:33.240 --> 21:34.740
My shoelace came undone and I tripped.

21:35.280 --> 21:36.620
You're not a kid anymore.

21:36.660 --> 21:37.820
Come here, I'll carry you.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.880
You're only making it worse.

21:41.220 --> 21:43.300
I'm not a kid.
I don't need you to carry me.

21:44.900 --> 21:46.220
Stop being so polite with me.

21:46.260 --> 21:48.740
You looks stumbled from your steps.

21:48.780 --> 21:49.940
Watching you limp is painful.

21:49.980 --> 21:51.880
Then close your eyes.

21:51.920 --> 21:52.760
Don't look.

21:55.980 --> 21:57.100
Lin Yingtao.

21:57.600 --> 21:58.920
You've got snot on your face.

22:03.020 --> 22:04.240
I do not.

22:04.280 --> 22:06.560
Remember those chocolate liquor candies

22:06.600 --> 22:07.500
at Uncle Tan's wedding?

22:07.540 --> 22:08.940
Du Shang and I scarfed ours down,

22:08.980 --> 22:11.300
then you pulled out your one
and waved it in our faces.

22:11.340 --> 22:13.040
Then you dropped it in the ditch

22:13.080 --> 22:15.920
and cried forever. Your snot dried
on your cheeks. You didn't even…

22:15.960 --> 22:18.460
Stop! Stop talking! Still laughing at me?

22:18.500 --> 22:19.940
You and Cai Fangyuan…

22:19.980 --> 22:21.240
You to are total scaredy-cats.

22:21.280 --> 22:24.420
Climbed that giant locust tree,
got scared stiff halfway up.

22:24.460 --> 22:26.640
Then Wei Yong walked by
and made both of you shout like…

22:26.680 --> 22:27.520
Shut up already.

22:28.220 --> 22:29.420
Easy… slow down.

22:44.140 --> 22:45.620
- Come on.
- What are you doing?

22:46.880 --> 22:48.200
Hey! Put me down.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.640
- I can walk just fine!
- Let's go.

22:50.140 --> 22:51.140
- Quit it!
- Alright, alright!

22:51.180 --> 22:52.980
I can't see! Let go!

22:54.300 --> 22:55.940
I've got legs. Don't need a ride.

22:57.260 --> 22:59.500
We've known each other forever.
We've seen it all.

22:59.540 --> 23:01.340
We're just a few years older now.

23:01.380 --> 23:03.040
You suddenly put on that apologist face?

23:03.080 --> 23:05.980
No means no. You're not carrying me.

23:06.560 --> 23:07.620
Why not?

23:08.120 --> 23:09.640
Someone's gonna end up getting hurt.

23:11.900 --> 23:13.240
The way you're now is hurtful.

23:13.280 --> 23:14.560
What did I even do?

23:16.660 --> 23:19.180
Puffy eyes don't lie.
Who could possibly be more hurt than you?

23:36.620 --> 23:38.420
Can you grab me some water and tissues?

23:38.460 --> 23:39.300
Thanks.

23:41.580 --> 23:42.420
What are you doing?

23:48.780 --> 23:51.140
Just water and tissues.
I don't need your money.

23:51.640 --> 23:52.480
Take it.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.000
Here.

24:20.120 --> 24:21.140
Drink a little first.

24:28.940 --> 24:29.880
Slow down.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.820
Aren't you curious

24:34.860 --> 24:36.180
why I came all the way to the city?

24:38.260 --> 24:40.380
Come over to my place later.
What you want to eat?

24:47.540 --> 24:49.340
I went to your school today.

24:50.500 --> 24:52.340
Heard a lot of stuff. About me.

24:52.840 --> 24:54.760
Shouldn't you be the one
explaining something?

24:55.500 --> 24:56.340
About…

24:57.080 --> 24:57.980
Jiang Qiaoxi.

25:00.740 --> 25:01.580
Yingtao,

25:02.860 --> 25:05.440
you really need to
stop thinking about him.

25:06.040 --> 25:08.460
He's not the same person
we knew growing up.

25:11.380 --> 25:12.300
Then who is he?

25:14.620 --> 25:17.680
Ever since he came to the city,
he's kept his distance from us.

25:17.720 --> 25:19.340
Like we were never even part of his life.

25:20.840 --> 25:24.660
Yingtao, from now on, let's just
pretend we never knew him either.

25:30.860 --> 25:31.780
So

25:32.940 --> 25:35.440
that's why he never reached out…

25:36.200 --> 25:38.080
And every time I asked about him,

25:38.120 --> 25:40.020
you guys just said
he was studying or too busy.

25:41.340 --> 25:43.460
It… It was Qin Yeyun.

25:44.380 --> 25:46.940
She said girls get emotional,
so she told everyone

25:47.440 --> 25:48.460
not to tell you anything.

25:52.960 --> 25:53.980
Then what about the letter?

25:54.480 --> 25:56.680
What happened with that?
Why did it suddenly become public?

25:56.720 --> 25:58.560
It was Fei Linge. He passed it around.

25:58.600 --> 25:59.980
He is Jiang Qiaoxi's friend now.

26:00.020 --> 26:02.020
- Today, I…
- So Jiang Qiaoxi told him to?

26:03.240 --> 26:05.420
Even if he didn't, he still let it happen.

26:21.780 --> 26:23.380
I saw him today.

26:25.300 --> 26:26.900
He's way taller now.

26:28.320 --> 26:30.100
But I recognized him in an instant.

26:33.020 --> 26:36.020
And he said he didn't know me
right in front of everyone.

26:38.940 --> 26:40.520
How could he turn into
that kind of person?

26:42.260 --> 26:43.100
Yingtao…

26:44.420 --> 26:47.600
You used to say
the city eats people alive.

26:48.140 --> 26:48.980
Think of it like this.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.160
The Jiang Qiaoxi we knew

26:51.700 --> 26:53.260
got eaten by the city.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.140
True.

27:02.100 --> 27:03.700
Fresh and bone swallowed. Nothing left.

27:05.260 --> 27:07.180
If my parents knew you were here,

27:07.220 --> 27:08.800
they'd be over the moon.

27:09.660 --> 27:10.720
Of course they would.

27:11.220 --> 27:14.780
Uncle Yu and Auntie Zhang
adored me back in Qunshan.

27:14.820 --> 27:15.840
Exactly.

27:15.880 --> 27:19.320
My mom used to joke about kidnapping you
so you could be their daughter instead.

27:30.200 --> 27:32.320
- What is it?
- That's Jiang's car.

27:32.820 --> 27:35.260
The building ahead is for cadre housing.

27:35.300 --> 27:38.040
SOLIDARITY, COMPASSION,
PROFESSIONALISM, DEVOTION

27:49.440 --> 27:51.260
Auntie Liang, I'm not going up.

27:51.300 --> 27:52.220
I'll grab a cab home.

27:54.000 --> 27:55.100
Xiaoman,

27:55.140 --> 27:56.320
I'll call your parents

27:56.360 --> 27:57.480
to come pick you up.

27:57.520 --> 27:58.640
No, it's okay, Auntie Liang.

27:59.140 --> 28:01.620
And please…
don't tell them what happened today.

28:05.660 --> 28:08.180
Honestly, I'm really disappointed in you.

28:08.220 --> 28:11.260
At your age, you should focus on studies.

28:11.300 --> 28:12.640
How can you hang around with him?

28:12.680 --> 28:14.100
I understand, Auntie Liang.

28:14.600 --> 28:16.940
But please don't blame Jiang Qiaoxi.

28:16.980 --> 28:18.320
We won't let this happen again.

28:19.140 --> 28:20.080
So…

28:21.360 --> 28:22.360
where

28:23.560 --> 28:24.920
do you think they went?

28:26.580 --> 28:27.500
Who knows?

28:28.000 --> 28:29.900
That girl's name is Cen Xiaoman.

28:30.400 --> 28:32.720
They say she's the prettiest girl
in class.

28:33.220 --> 28:34.140
And she's smart too.

28:34.180 --> 28:36.100
Jiang Qiaoxi is first in the class.

28:36.140 --> 28:36.980
She's second.

28:42.380 --> 28:44.400
Are they close?

28:46.740 --> 28:49.040
That… I don't know.

28:50.120 --> 28:51.980
He stopped talking to us a long time ago.

28:52.480 --> 28:53.960
Now he hangs out with the smart kids.

28:57.020 --> 28:58.820
Girls like her.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.640
There are others too.

29:05.140 --> 29:07.920
There's this one guy.
Kind of a jerk, actually.

29:10.880 --> 29:13.060
I heard someone wrote him a love letter,

29:13.560 --> 29:14.940
and it caused a huge scene.

29:19.100 --> 29:21.560
Plenty of girls write to Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:22.060 --> 29:23.540
But he never responds to any of them.

29:26.720 --> 29:29.300
- Let me take you home.
- It's fine. Really, I'm okay.

29:29.340 --> 29:30.520
You all go home and rest.

29:31.820 --> 29:33.020
Alright then.

29:33.060 --> 29:34.400
- Be safe.
- I will.

29:42.740 --> 29:43.740
So tell me…

29:44.820 --> 29:48.000
Do you think he let my letter
get passed around

29:49.880 --> 29:51.840
because of that girl?

29:56.100 --> 29:57.920
That's beyond me.

29:58.500 --> 29:59.620
I really don't know.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.300
Let's head back.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.300
They're here.

30:09.340 --> 30:10.180
Yu Qiao!

30:12.020 --> 30:12.860
Coming!

30:14.780 --> 30:15.700
- Lin Yingtao!
- Hey…

30:15.740 --> 30:17.040
- Yingtao!
- Yingtao.

30:21.000 --> 30:22.940
You two are way too late.

30:22.980 --> 30:23.900
She already left.

30:24.460 --> 30:25.300
She left?

30:27.660 --> 30:30.000
Alright. Guess we should head out too.

30:32.080 --> 30:33.340
- You two…
- Lin Yingtao!

30:33.380 --> 30:34.220
Lin…

30:35.920 --> 30:36.920
Yingtao…

30:37.860 --> 30:41.260
You think we won't recognize you now?

30:41.300 --> 30:43.640
I knew you wouldn't leave
without seeing us first.

30:45.380 --> 30:47.140
You two are way better at finding me now

30:47.180 --> 30:49.420
than when we played hide-and-seek as kids.

30:49.460 --> 30:50.300
Alright…

30:50.840 --> 30:53.080
Qin Yeyun told me
to bring you clothes to change.

30:53.900 --> 30:56.580
She said she's helping her dad
sort inventory, so she couldn't make it.

30:58.060 --> 30:59.840
How's Uncle Qin's leg?

31:00.460 --> 31:01.900
He won't spend a dime at the hospital.

31:01.940 --> 31:02.840
Still doing his qigong.

31:03.460 --> 31:04.800
Will those exercises work?

31:05.380 --> 31:06.900
Only he believes they do.

31:06.940 --> 31:07.980
Probably just a mental thing.

31:08.020 --> 31:09.560
- He says he is better now.
- Be careful.

31:09.600 --> 31:10.640
Okay.

31:11.180 --> 31:12.580
Eat up.

31:14.220 --> 31:15.280
- Wow.
- Easy now.

31:15.320 --> 31:16.580
Alright, alright, I've got it.

31:17.080 --> 31:18.000
- Wow.
- Hey.

31:18.040 --> 31:19.140
Yingtao,

31:19.180 --> 31:20.900
come on, tell us about life in Qunshan.

31:20.940 --> 31:23.020
I miss those days so much.

31:23.060 --> 31:25.280
Did they tear down my row of houses?

31:26.260 --> 31:27.760
Almost all gone now.

31:33.000 --> 31:36.920
How's life in Qunshan?
Kind of lonely, I guess?

31:42.860 --> 31:44.100
You guys probably forgot

31:44.980 --> 31:46.440
about the strawberry field, huh?

31:47.020 --> 31:48.360
Still grows every year.

31:48.900 --> 31:50.080
The sunflowers bloom too.

31:50.580 --> 31:51.420
That big locust tree.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.980
It still blossoms in spring.
So many flowers,

31:54.020 --> 31:55.540
I can't even finish them all.

31:56.700 --> 31:59.180
Mom still makes steamed
locust blossom rice, just for me now.

31:59.220 --> 32:00.380
Let me tell you, I feel amazing.

32:02.980 --> 32:04.640
Enough about me. How about you guys?

32:04.680 --> 32:06.800
Yingtao, your parents are here!

32:08.180 --> 32:09.160
- Come in.
- Ping.

32:09.660 --> 32:10.580
- Yingtao.
- Dad!

32:11.560 --> 32:12.560
Ow! You almost crushed me!

32:13.060 --> 32:15.420
You're not going anywhere.
Told you! No way we'd ever lose you.

32:15.460 --> 32:17.540
Wherever you go,
your mom and I will always find you.

32:17.580 --> 32:18.580
See?

32:18.620 --> 32:19.700
You scared us half to death.

32:19.740 --> 32:20.980
- She's fine.
- I am sorry.

32:21.020 --> 32:22.520
Come on, she's here with us,

32:22.560 --> 32:24.000
- safe and sound.
- Yeah, see?

32:24.040 --> 32:26.160
- She's here at the Yu house.
- Of course she is.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.500
- Sit, Haifeng.
- Have a seat.

32:27.540 --> 32:29.180
- Come. Sit.
- Here, let me take your bag.

32:29.220 --> 32:30.900
Sorry for worrying you both.

32:30.940 --> 32:32.380
Next time, at least let us know first.

32:32.880 --> 32:34.300
Actually, we've decided something.

32:34.340 --> 32:35.340
You've decided?

32:35.380 --> 32:37.940
Yingtao's transferring to Jialin
Experimental Middle School.

32:37.980 --> 32:39.300
Yingtao, listen to me.

32:39.340 --> 32:40.600
No more living in Qunshan.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.520
Transfer here.

32:41.560 --> 32:42.720
Go to school with your friends.

32:42.760 --> 32:43.840
It'll be great.

32:43.880 --> 32:46.020
Lin, take our advice.

32:46.520 --> 32:49.100
The project's only got
another year left anyway.

32:49.140 --> 32:50.760
Exactly, Haifeng.

32:50.800 --> 32:52.300
And you both know

32:52.340 --> 32:56.260
Yingtao loves being around people.
She's happiest with a big crowd.

32:56.760 --> 32:57.600
You really think

32:57.640 --> 33:00.380
she's there alone in Qunshan
and loving it?

33:00.420 --> 33:02.920
I'm happy wherever I am, Auntie Zhang.

33:03.740 --> 33:06.900
- Yingtao, it's ok to be a kid.
- That's right.

33:06.940 --> 33:09.420
We watched you grow up.

33:09.920 --> 33:11.380
Even if your parents don't say it,

33:11.420 --> 33:12.560
when it comes to school,

33:12.600 --> 33:14.500
- we've already made the arrangements.
- Yeah.

33:15.880 --> 33:17.520
If Manager Jiang were here today,

33:17.560 --> 33:20.440
he could even help to
speed up the paperwork for your house.

33:20.480 --> 33:21.580
No rush.

33:21.620 --> 33:24.200
He knew you two were coming,
said he'd drop by to say hello.

33:24.900 --> 33:26.660
But then something came up.

33:27.600 --> 33:30.400
I heard Qiaoxi ran off
with a girl from his class.

33:31.140 --> 33:33.440
- Liang Hongfei had to bring him back.
- Well.

33:33.480 --> 33:34.400
- Heh.
- Oh.

33:34.980 --> 33:36.200
It's alright.

33:39.940 --> 33:41.140
You two, slow down!

33:42.400 --> 33:44.220
Where are you even taking me?

33:44.720 --> 33:46.860
Du Shang, can you go any faster?

33:46.900 --> 33:47.820
Yu Qiao, slow down!

33:47.860 --> 33:48.980
Du Shang's got Yingtao!

33:49.020 --> 33:51.320
Yeah, I'm carrying someone here!
You two slow it down!

33:51.360 --> 33:52.740
Lin Yingtao!

33:52.780 --> 33:54.540
Are you that heavy?

33:54.580 --> 33:56.820
Heavy? Look at yourself!
You think you're light?

33:56.860 --> 33:58.200
Hop on Du Shang's bike then.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.060
What is your problem?

34:07.100 --> 34:09.100
Climbing around the park at night?

34:09.900 --> 34:10.800
Come on.

34:10.840 --> 34:12.139
Just get inside. You'll see.

34:12.179 --> 34:13.620
- Come on, heroine.
- Hurry.

34:13.659 --> 34:14.880
What are you guys up to?

34:15.420 --> 34:16.940
I can climb it myself.

34:16.980 --> 34:18.020
Watch your step.

34:21.360 --> 34:22.380
Wow, not bad.

34:23.260 --> 34:24.679
You're quick.

34:25.699 --> 34:26.760
Wait for me!

34:27.420 --> 34:28.260
Careful.

34:38.380 --> 34:39.219
Hurry!

34:55.139 --> 34:56.340
Way farther than I thought.

34:56.380 --> 34:59.220
Yingtao, remember that cliff?
We never made it past.

34:59.720 --> 35:02.980
We hiked so far but never got to see
that big goose you were talking about.

35:04.220 --> 35:06.260
Well, these swans today?

35:06.300 --> 35:07.500
Let's say they're your geese.

35:08.700 --> 35:11.100
Look, Yingtao. That one swan

35:11.140 --> 35:12.560
is the boldest. Always showing off.

35:13.260 --> 35:15.860
We all agreed that it is most alike to you
when you were little.

35:15.900 --> 35:17.760
Right? Don't you think so?

35:29.900 --> 35:31.200
That's ruthless.

35:31.740 --> 35:32.880
Huh?

35:32.920 --> 35:35.160
The big city hasn't
swallowed you up after all.

35:36.620 --> 35:38.800
Yingtao, come to the city.

35:39.600 --> 35:40.760
It's not that you need us.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.280
We need you.

35:43.280 --> 35:45.860
Ugh, do you have to be so corny?

35:46.400 --> 35:48.240
Ignore him. He's always been like that.

35:50.300 --> 35:52.080
You guys are the worst!

35:52.580 --> 35:55.920
Yingtao. We've done all this for you.
So? Are you coming or not?

36:03.860 --> 36:05.480
I can't stand you guys.

36:07.620 --> 36:08.560
Stop crying, Yingtao.

36:10.440 --> 36:11.820
Hey, look behind you.

36:11.860 --> 36:12.700
Someone's there.

36:13.200 --> 36:14.720
- What the hell?
- Hey you.

36:15.620 --> 36:16.660
Careful, careful.

36:18.340 --> 36:20.840
Cai Fangyuan, you jerk!

36:20.880 --> 36:23.980
Last one up! Watch your back!

36:26.520 --> 36:27.380
Oi!

36:27.880 --> 36:28.720
Hey you.

36:29.220 --> 36:30.060
- Slow down.
- Oi!

36:31.240 --> 36:32.080
Yu Qiao is the last!

36:32.120 --> 36:33.880
- Yu Qiao, you're the last one.
- Coming…

36:33.920 --> 36:35.420
Slow down, careful!

37:05.360 --> 37:06.240
Yingtao.

37:18.340 --> 37:19.240
Why did you come here?

37:19.280 --> 37:21.860
Qin Yeyun told me you were here.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.220
I came to find you.

37:26.680 --> 37:27.940
Do we even know each other?

37:38.020 --> 37:39.980
I'm sorry, Yingtao.

37:50.380 --> 37:51.540
Then why did you say

37:52.220 --> 37:53.180
you didn't know me?

37:57.560 --> 37:59.520
I didn't know what else to do.

38:00.600 --> 38:01.740
At the time…

38:03.020 --> 38:04.160
it felt like the best solution.

38:04.200 --> 38:05.520
Best solution?

38:08.140 --> 38:10.460
So, in your mind,

38:10.500 --> 38:12.220
pretending that you don't to know me

38:12.260 --> 38:14.620
was your way of keeping me safe?

38:16.040 --> 38:18.140
Like that would stop people from talking?

38:20.840 --> 38:22.640
But you had other choices.

38:24.060 --> 38:26.260
You could've just said we are friends.

38:27.020 --> 38:27.860
We were friends.

38:28.500 --> 38:30.100
That the letter wasn't a love letter.

38:30.140 --> 38:31.520
That Chunlu was a rabbit.

38:39.180 --> 38:40.800
It wasn't something

38:41.340 --> 38:42.640
I could say at the time.

38:46.200 --> 38:49.500
Not with someone else presented there.
Awkward, right?

39:17.300 --> 39:18.360
Let's take another way.

39:38.020 --> 39:40.400
JIALIN CITY POWER CONSTRUCTION
HOUSING COMPOUND

39:47.800 --> 39:49.700
That girl's name is Cen Xiaoman.

39:50.200 --> 39:52.480
They say she's the prettiest girl
in class.

39:52.980 --> 39:54.140
And she's smart too.

39:54.180 --> 39:55.860
Jiang Qiaoxi is first in the class.

39:55.900 --> 39:56.740
She's second.

39:58.020 --> 39:59.920
He stopped talking to us a long time ago.

40:00.420 --> 40:02.300
Now he only hangs out with the smart kids.

40:05.260 --> 40:06.800
It wasn't something

40:07.440 --> 40:08.980
I could say at the time.

40:09.560 --> 40:12.940
Not with someone else presented there.
Awkward, right?

40:18.820 --> 40:19.720
I heard

40:19.760 --> 40:22.180
Qiaoxi ran off with a girl from his class.

40:22.220 --> 40:23.800
Liang Hongfei had to bring him back.

45:03.820 --> 45:05.800
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
